(7676014, 1254089, 259105, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club!<br/> <br/>Hello Satvinder. Nice photo, there''s not an overly excessive amount of yellow but it''s there and subtle which I like about it. In my opinion, the branch underneath the one the bird is perched on is doing nothing and you could just crop it out of the photo. The isolation of the subject is good, but I would like to see just a bit more of the background around the bird.<br/> <br/>Great photo Satvinder, and good luck on future challenges!</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club! Hello Satvinder. Nice photo, there''s not an overly excessive amount of yellow but it''s there and subtle which I like about it. In my opinion, the branch underneath the one the bird is perched on is doing nothing and you could just crop it out of the photo. The isolation of the subject is good, but I would like to see just a bit more of the background around the bird. Great photo Satvinder, and good luck on future challenges!', '2020-10-06 12:41:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(7676015, 1254199, 259105, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club!<br/> <br/>Hey Konstantin. Nice photo I really like the yellows and oranges, the only thing with color is I wish the green popped just a bit more. Also, I wish the cars weren''t there because they''re a bit distracting. I really like the lines in the rode. Also, the photo is exposed beautifully! Great photo!<br/> <br/>Feel free to PM me with more questions, and hopefully, you do even better on your next photo.</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club! Hey Konstantin. Nice photo I really like the yellows and oranges, the only thing with color is I wish the green popped just a bit more. Also, I wish the cars weren''t there because they''re a bit distracting. I really like the lines in the rode. Also, the photo is exposed beautifully! Great photo! Feel free to PM me with more questions, and hopefully, you do even better on your next photo.', '2020-10-06 12:45:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(7676018, 1254157, 259105, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club!<br/> <br/>Hello Tulika. This is a really good photo. It has a really good composition and exposure. But one major thing: It''s not yellow, that''s why it scored badly. Next time just make sure you submit your photo into the right challenge so that you don''t get a terrible score like 3.7872<br/> <br/>Feel free to PM me for more questions!</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club! Hello Tulika. This is a really good photo. It has a really good composition and exposure. But one major thing: It''s not yellow, that''s why it scored badly. Next time just make sure you submit your photo into the right challenge so that you don''t get a terrible score like 3.7872 Feel free to PM me for more questions!', '2020-10-06 14:21:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(7676075, 1254073, 259105, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club!<br/> <br/>Good photo. I really like how the yellows pop in this and the contrast of colors between the yellow and the nice blue sky. I thing is that the yellow leaves aren''t totally in focus and get a bit blurry towards the left side of the frame. What I would do for shooting a photo like this is get a tripod and shoot at f22 so that the entire frame is in focus.<br/> <br/>Feel free to PM me with any questions, and good luck on the challenges to come!</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club! Good photo. I really like how the yellows pop in this and the contrast of colors between the yellow and the nice blue sky. I thing is that the yellow leaves aren''t totally in focus and get a bit blurry towards the left side of the frame. What I would do for shooting a photo like this is get a tripod and shoot at f22 so that the entire frame is in focus. Feel free to PM me with any questions, and good luck on the challenges to come!', '2020-10-07 11:17:37.000000', NULL, 0);
